{"total_count": 1, "incomplete_results": false, "items": [{"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/223", "repository_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli", "labels_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/223/labels{/name}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/223/comments", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/223/events", "html_url": "https://github.com/hukkin/tomli/issues/223", "id": 1996979810, "node_id": "I_kwDOFhcp3c53B35i", "number": 223, "title": "Incorrect error message", "user": {"login": "mechsin", "id": 3707810, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjM3MDc4MTA=", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3707810?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/mechsin", "html_url": "https://github.com/mechsin", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mechsin/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mechsin/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mechsin/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mechsin/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mechsin/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mechsin/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mechsin/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mechsin/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/mechsin/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "labels": [{"id": 3029283665, "node_id": "MDU6TGFiZWwzMDI5MjgzNjY1", "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/labels/enhancement", "name": "enhancement", "color": "a2eeef", "default": true, "description": "New feature or request"}], "state": "closed", "locked": false, "assignees": [], "milestone": null, "comments": 2, "created_at": "2023-11-16T14:25:51Z", "updated_at": "2024-10-21T13:04:35Z", "closed_at": "2024-10-02T05:25:58Z", "assignee": null, "author_association": "NONE", "active_lock_reason": null, "sub_issues_summary": {"total": 0, "completed": 0, "percent_completed": 0}, "issue_dependencies_summary": {"blocked_by": 0, "total_blocked_by": 0, "blocking": 0, "total_blocking": 0}, "body": "I ran across an incorrect error message while using `tomli.loads`. See the snippet below\r\n\r\n```\r\nimport tomli\r\n>>> tomli_str = b'test=\"a\"'\r\n>>> tomli.loads(tomli_str)\r\nTraceback (most recent call last):\r\n  File \"<stdin>\", line 1, in <module>\r\n  File \"venv\\lib\\site-packages\\tomli\\_parser.py\", line 74, in loads\r\n    src = __s.replace(\"\\r\\n\", \"\\n\")\r\nTypeError: a bytes-like object is required, not 'str'\r\n```\r\n\r\nNote the actual text of of the type error. It indicates it wants \"`a bytes-like object is required, not 'str'`\". Except it was passed a bytes like object and consulting the documentation `loads` actually wants a `str` object. So error message text is wrong and in fact opposite of what the function actually wants.\r\n\r\nI generated this error using tomli 2.0.1", "reactions": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/223/reactions", "total_count": 0, "+1": 0, "-1": 0, "laugh": 0, "hooray": 0, "confused": 0, "heart": 0, "rocket": 0, "eyes": 0}, "timeline_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/hukkin/tomli/issues/223/timeline", "performed_via_github_app": null, "state_reason": "completed", "pinned_comment": null, "score": 1.0}], "search_type": "lexical"}